Package: CLIC
Title: Feature Selection via Confidence Scores of Cross-modal Links 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tomoya", "Furutani", email= "furutomo.49@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hongkai", "Ji", email = "hji@jhu.edu", role=c("aut")))
Maintainer: Tomoya Furutani <furutomo.49@gmail.com>
Description: CLIC implements a hybrid feature selection method, incorporating confidence scores of feature 
    links between scRNA-seq and scATAC-seq data in addition to standard expression variability to improve cross-modal integration. 
    The confidence scores are computed via multimodal datasets from ENCODE(The Encyclopedia of DNA Elements) project. 
